{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/613772-dark-age","id":613772,"title":"Dark Age?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-03T12:18:18-07:00","id":613772,"title":"Dark Age?","content":"Demon rely heavily on technology. But how did the whole setting worked in dark age for example? Were the infrastructures the same? Did all this technology existed or did it appear recently? Likewise, some powers could probably not work the same way they do or did they existed at all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6912-leamundis","name":"Leamundis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-03T12:24:21-07:00","id":613799,"title":"","content":"Truefacs: God-Machine once used a Horse Shed as infrastructure.<br /> <br /> The Machine it'self is always hyperadvanced-it uses technologies and scientific principlies that can only be in the future. But when it builds infrastructure, it works with what's available in the era. In the Bronze era, it'll use Bronze statues, but it's angels still have lasers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-04T02:54:15-07:00","id":614743,"title":"","content":"What do you mean by that? Will this bronze statue, for example, be just a inert bronze statue hiding some infrastructure producing energy or can the statue be motorized, like a golem?<br /> Based on what you say, I'd be inclined to think it's the latter. So, encountering technology like embedded or exploited firearms or machinery, even electronics, is conceivable?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6912-leamundis","name":"Leamundis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-04T08:28:03-07:00","id":615138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leamundis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/613772-dark-age?p=614743#post614743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What do you mean by that? Will this bronze statue, for example, be just a inert bronze statue hiding some infrastructure producing energy or can the statue be motorized, like a golem?<br /> Based on what you say, I'd be inclined to think it's the latter. So, encountering technology like embedded or exploited firearms or machinery, even electronics, is conceivable?</div> </div> </div> </div>The statue is covered in gold wire filigree, twisted in intricate mathematical patterns. When you put your hand on the statue, you hear a mechanical clicking, almost but not quite in time with a human heart beat. If you look at it for more than four minutes, you get a metallic taste in your mouth.<br /> <br /> As for embedded technology, think alchemy: furnaces purifying metal, vats of mercury and vitriol, and clock punk: bronze gears, brass mirrors redirecting sunlight, other, stranger mechanisms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-04T12:03:32-07:00","id":615421,"title":"","content":"I'll use an example from a book.<br /> <br /> In no way can you use wood to make a frying pan, right? But for the God-Machine, who understands the weird sciences of this world far better than anyone here, if you get the right kind of wood and carve it the right kind of way, you can.<br /> <br /> THe God-Machine <i>has</i> advanced technology at all times, but doesn't <i>need</i> to use it because the God-Machine understands the occult physics behind the world so well it can do what it needs to do with the materials of the time. The God-machine can make supernatural infrastructure out of a Bronze statue-a bronze golem is perfectly usable as Defense Infrastructure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T05:06:54-07:00","id":617622,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/613772-dark-age?p=615421#post615421\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll use an example from a book.<br /> <br /> In no way can you use wood to make a frying pan, right? But for the God-Machine, who understands the weird sciences of this world far better than anyone here, if you get the right kind of wood and carve it the right kind of way, you can.<br /> <br /> THe God-Machine <i>has</i> advanced technology at all times, but doesn't <i>need</i> to use it because the God-Machine understands the occult physics behind the world so well it can do what it needs to do with the materials of the time. The God-machine can make supernatural infrastructure out of a Bronze statue-a bronze golem is perfectly usable as Defense Infrastructure.</div> </div> </div> </div>At the same time, it normally can't just make wooden frying pans out of thin air, people still have to carve it with their dallish elven daggers from the magical robot tree the wood comes from XD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T08:32:48-07:00","id":617788,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/613772-dark-age?p=617622#post617622\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> At the same time, it normally can't just make wooden frying pans out of thin air, people still have to carve it with their dallish elven daggers from the magical robot tree the wood comes from XD</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, it might have to be wood from a specific kind of tree of a specific age that's been soaked in a specific kind of oil (or blood) while a high priest is chanting, but these are all materials that you can find during a specific age.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T12:34:09-07:00","id":617929,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BigDamnHero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/613772-dark-age?p=617788#post617788\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, it might have to be wood from a specific kind of tree of a specific age that's been soaked in a specific kind of oil (or blood) while a high priest is chanting, but these are all materials that you can find during a specific age.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is on point. This is the way it works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T14:26:41-07:00","id":618082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leamundis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/613772-dark-age?p=614743#post614743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What do you mean by that? Will this bronze statue, for example, be just a inert bronze statue hiding some infrastructure producing energy or can the statue be motorized, like a golem?<br /> Based on what you say, I'd be inclined to think it's the latter. So, encountering technology like embedded or exploited firearms or machinery, even electronics, is conceivable?</div> </div> </div> </div>Conceivable, but not common. The God-Machine values subtlety, patience and smooth manipulation. Infrastructure resembling high levels of technology in the modern sense \u2014 anachronistic things like lasers, ID scanners, motorized elevators, antigravity engines and industrial drills \u2014 is likely to be reserved for situations where the utility of the occult technology outweighs the difficulty of concealing it. That is to say, either very important, high-yield projects under high guard, or facilities deep within the God-Machine's security zones, past the point where most mortals would be unable to pass. Surface projects, like everyday labor installations in urban centers or minor search dragnets in the wilderness, probably blend in more easily, using less overtly anachronistic constructions: invisible magical alignments, clockwork apparati and machinery that harness organic work-groups. The more obviously awry and unknowable the technology, the more likely you've found yourself in the middle of a very dangerous situation.<br /> <br /> None of the above would be an ironclad rule, mind. I expect there would be a lot of situations where the different aesthetics are mashed together, and even beasts of burden employed in &quot;primitive&quot; works of the God-Machine likely are unnaturally warped and engineered, or extracted from some unknown space.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}